{
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Order Detail - Progress stepper (주문 진행단계, 탭 위 상시 노출)"
    },
    "comment": "진행단계 스텝퍼. 배열은 서버(`OrderProgressSteps`)가 만든다 — 순서는 상태 Enum(`progressSequence`)의 지식이고 회원·비회원 상세도 같은 배열을 받는다. 화면이 순서를 다시 적으면 그 사본이 어휘의 두 번째 출처가 된다. 탭 밖에 두어 어느 탭에서도 보인다.",
    "id": "order_progress_card",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{(order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []).length > 0}}",
    "props": {
        "className": "ecommerce-admin-card",
        "data-section-id": "order_progress"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "H2",
            "props": {
                "className": "ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-bold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-100 ecommerce:mb-6"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.order.detail.progress_title"
        },
        {
            "comment": "진행단계 칸 — 클레임 상세와 같은 구조. 7단계 + 이탈 칸(배송보류·취소·교환/반품).",
            "id": "order_progress_steps",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "responsive": {
                "portable": {
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:grid ecommerce:grid-cols-4 ecommerce:gap-x-2 ecommerce:gap-y-5"
                    }
                }
            },
            "props": {
                "className": "{{(order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []).length > 9 ? 'ecommerce:grid ecommerce:grid-cols-6 ecommerce:gap-x-2 ecommerce:gap-y-6' : 'ecommerce:grid ecommerce:grid-flow-col ecommerce:auto-cols-fr ecommerce:gap-x-2 ecommerce:gap-y-6'}}"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "order_progress_step_{{stepIdx}}",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "iteration": {
                        "source": "{{order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []}}",
                        "item_var": "step",
                        "index_var": "stepIdx"
                    },
                    "props": {
                        "className": "ecommerce:relative ecommerce:flex ecommerce:flex-col ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:min-w-0",
                        "data-step-value": "{{step.value ?? ''}}",
                        "data-step-state": "{{step.state ?? ''}}"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "comment": "원 크기와 아이콘 크기는 이 래퍼가 정한다 — 아이콘은 글리프라 부모 font-size 를 물려받는다. 모바일은 4칸/줄이라 한 단계 작게.",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:w-14 ecommerce:h-14 ecommerce:text-xl"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:w-16 ecommerce:h-16 ecommerce:text-2xl"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "comment": "색은 상태 뱃지와 같은 variant 팔레트 — 지나간 칸은 그 상태 색으로 채우고, 현재 칸은 옅은 바탕에 테두리·그림자, 남은 칸은 회색, 이탈(배송보류·취소·교환/반품)은 빨강.",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "classMap": {
                                        "base": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:justify-center ecommerce:w-full ecommerce:h-full ecommerce:rounded-full ecommerce:border-2",
                                        "key": "{{step.state + ':' + (step.variant ?? 'secondary')}}",
                                        "variants": {
                                            "done:success": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-green-700 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-green-700",
                                            "current:success": "ecommerce:border-green-600 ecommerce:bg-green-100 ecommerce:text-green-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-green-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-green-400",
                                            "off_path:success": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:warning": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-yellow-700 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-700",
                                            "current:warning": "ecommerce:border-yellow-600 ecommerce:bg-yellow-100 ecommerce:text-yellow-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-yellow-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-yellow-400",
                                            "off_path:warning": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:info": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-blue-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-600",
                                            "current:info": "ecommerce:border-blue-600 ecommerce:bg-blue-100 ecommerce:text-blue-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-blue-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-blue-400",
                                            "off_path:info": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:primary": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-indigo-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-indigo-500",
                                            "current:primary": "ecommerce:border-indigo-600 ecommerce:bg-indigo-100 ecommerce:text-indigo-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-indigo-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-indigo-300",
                                            "off_path:primary": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:secondary": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-gray-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-500",
                                            "current:secondary": "ecommerce:border-gray-600 ecommerce:bg-gray-100 ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300",
                                            "off_path:secondary": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:danger": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "current:danger": "ecommerce:border-red-500 ecommerce:bg-red-100 ecommerce:text-red-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-red-900/30 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400",
                                            "off_path:danger": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600",
                                            "done:dark": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-slate-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-slate-500",
                                            "current:dark": "ecommerce:border-slate-600 ecommerce:bg-slate-200 ecommerce:text-slate-800 ecommerce:shadow-md ecommerce:dark:bg-slate-800 ecommerce:dark:text-slate-200",
                                            "off_path:dark": "ecommerce:border-transparent ecommerce:bg-red-600 ecommerce:text-white ecommerce:dark:bg-red-600"
                                        },
                                        "default": "ecommerce:border-gray-300 ecommerce:bg-white ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:border-gray-600 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-800 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "{{step.icon ?? 'circle'}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "라벨은 칸 폭 안에서 띄어쓰기 기준으로 줄바꿈한다 — nowrap 이면 언어에 따라 칸 폭이 달라진다.",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Span",
                            "classMap": {
                                "base": "ecommerce:w-full ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-center ecommerce:break-words ecommerce-break-words ecommerce:leading-tight",
                                "key": "{{step.state}}",
                                "variants": {
                                    "done": "ecommerce:text-gray-700 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-300",
                                    "current": "ecommerce:font-bold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-100",
                                    "upcoming": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400",
                                    "off_path": "ecommerce:font-bold ecommerce:text-red-600 ecommerce:dark:text-red-400"
                                },
                                "default": "ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                            },
                            "text": "{{step.label ?? ''}}"
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "칸 사이 꺾쇠 (PC) — 마지막 칸에는 없다. 칸이 10개 이상이면 PC 도 한 줄 6칸으로 줄바꿈하므로 그때는 줄 끝(6n번째)에도 세우지 않는다. 칸 오른쪽 경계에서 그리드 간격의 절반(-mr-1 = 4px)만큼 밀고 자기 폭의 절반을 되돌려(translate-x-1/2) 두 원 사이 정중앙에 세운다 — 칸 폭이 몇이든 양쪽 원과의 거리가 같다. 숨김은 래퍼 Div 가 맡는다: Icon 에 직접 `hidden` 을 주면 Font Awesome 의 `display` 규칙(레이어 밖)이 Tailwind 유틸리티(레이어 안)를 이겨 숨겨지지 않는다.",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{stepIdx < (order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []).length - 1 && ((order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []).length <= 9 || stepIdx % 6 !== 5)}}",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:hidden ecommerce-hidden",
                                        "data-step-chevron": "pc"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:absolute ecommerce:right-0 ecommerce:top-0 ecommerce:h-16 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:translate-x-1/2 ecommerce:-mr-1 ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-500",
                                "data-step-chevron": "pc"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "chevron-right"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "comment": "칸 사이 꺾쇠 (모바일) — 한 줄 4칸이라 줄 끝(4n번째) 칸에는 세우지 않는다.",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "if": "{{stepIdx < (order?.data?.progress_steps ?? []).length - 1 && stepIdx % 4 !== 3}}",
                            "responsive": {
                                "portable": {
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:absolute ecommerce:right-0 ecommerce:top-0 ecommerce:h-14 ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:translate-x-1/2 ecommerce:-mr-1 ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce:text-gray-500 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-500",
                                        "data-step-chevron": "mobile"
                                    }
                                }
                            },
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce:hidden ecommerce-hidden",
                                "data-step-chevron": "mobile"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Icon",
                                    "props": {
                                        "name": "chevron-right"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
